    "introduction": ["I am an undergraduate student in Artificial Intelligence at Shanghai Jiao Tong University, working on language-model systems with a primary focus on LLM agents, multi-agent systems, and model collaboration.", "我是上海交通大学人工智能专业本科生，主要研究大语言模型 Agent、多智能体系统与模型协作。", "我是上海交通大學人工智能專業本科生，主要研究大語言模型 Agent、多智能體系統與模型協作。"],
    "research": ["My research interests center on building capable and adaptive agent systems that can reason, coordinate, and act in complex environments. Recent work spans autonomous agent systems, hierarchical planning and recovery, cross-device interaction, continual learning, and efficient adaptation of large language models.", "我关注 Agent 系统如何在复杂环境中推理、协作和执行任务，并持续适应变化。近期研究包括自主 Agent、分层规划与恢复、跨设备交互、持续学习，以及大语言模型的高效适配。", "我關注 Agent 系統如何在複雜環境中推理、協作和執行任務，並持續適應變化。近期研究包括自主 Agent、分層規劃與恢復、跨裝置互動、持續學習，以及大語言模型的高效適配。"],
