    "parameter_efficient_adaptation_and_model_merging_can_add_new_capabilities_whil": ["Parameter-efficient adaptation and model merging can add new capabilities while preserving previously acquired knowledge.", "参数高效适配与模型合并可以在增加新能力的同时尽可能保留已有知识。", "參數高效適配與模型合併可以在增加新能力的同時盡可能保留已有知識。"],
