    "designed_and_implemented_h_replan_a_hierarchical_replanning_framework_for_cros": ["Designed and implemented H-RePlan, a hierarchical replanning framework for cross-device agents that separates device-local strategy recovery from orchestrator-level task and device reassignment.", "设计并实现 H-RePlan 分层重规划框架，将跨设备 Agent 的设备内策略恢复与编排层的任务和设备重新分配分离。", "設計並實現 H-RePlan 分層重規劃框架，將跨裝置 Agent 的裝置內策略恢復與編排層的任務和裝置重新分配分離。"],
    "added_an_llm_based_strategy_planner_that_selects_and_retries_api_cli_and_gui_e": ["Added an LLM-based strategy planner that selects and retries API, CLI, and GUI execution strategies within each device context.", "加入基于 LLM 的策略规划器，在每个设备上下文中选择并重试 API、CLI 和 GUI 执行策略。", "加入基於 LLM 的策略規劃器，在每個裝置上下文中選擇並重試 API、CLI 和 GUI 執行策略。"],
    "introduced_cross_layer_failure_events_clfes_to_compress_local_execution_eviden": ["Introduced Cross-Layer Failure Events (CLFEs) to compress local execution evidence into structured signals for orchestration-level replanning.", "提出 Cross-Layer Failure Events（CLFE），将设备内执行证据压缩为结构化信号，供编排层重规划使用。", "提出 Cross-Layer Failure Events（CLFE），將裝置內執行證據壓縮為結構化信號，供編排層重規劃使用。"],
    "integrated_capability_aware_strategy_bindings_retry_budgets_chain_history_and": ["Integrated capability-aware strategy bindings, retry budgets, chain history, and partial DAG-result reuse into the MDC/UFO³ execution flow.", "在 MDC/UFO³ 执行流程中集成能力感知的策略绑定、重试预算、执行链历史以及 DAG 部分结果复用。", "在 MDC/UFO³ 執行流程中集成能力感知的策略綁定、重試預算、執行鏈歷史以及 DAG 部分結果複用。"],
    "built_herabench_fault_injection_workflows_over_linux_and_android_devices_cover": ["Built HeraBench fault-injection workflows over Linux and Android devices, covering local, global, and mixed failures across 174 task variants.", "在 Linux 与 Android 设备上构建 HeraBench 故障注入流程，覆盖 174 个任务变体中的局部、全局和混合故障。", "在 Linux 與 Android 裝置上構建 HeraBench 故障注入流程，覆蓋 174 個任務變體中的局部、全局和混合故障。"],
