    "built_continual_learning_experiment_workflows_across_multiple_text_classificat": ["Built continual-learning experiment workflows across multiple text-classification task sequences.", "围绕多组文本分类任务序列搭建持续学习实验流程。", "圍繞多組文本分類任務序列搭建持續學習實驗流程。"],
    "organized_training_logs_metric_aggregation_and_ablation_records_for_reproducib": ["Organized training logs, metric aggregation, and ablation records for reproducible comparison.", "整理训练日志、指标汇总和消融实验记录，支持可复现比较。", "整理訓練日誌、指標匯總和消融實驗記錄，支援可重現比較。"],
    "conducted_a_reproducible_continual_control_study_on_network_capacity_and_mid_t": ["Conducted a reproducible continual-control study on network capacity and mid-training model expansion under hidden environment drift. Designed matched PPO experiments across multiple network widths, implemented controlled dynamic widening, and evaluated learning efficiency and held-out robustness under equal interaction budgets.", "围绕隐藏环境漂移下的网络容量与训练中期模型扩展开展可复现的持续控制研究。在多个网络宽度上设计配置匹配的 PPO 实验，实现受控的动态扩宽，并在相同交互预算下评估学习效率与留出环境上的鲁棒性。", "圍繞隱藏環境漂移下的網路容量與訓練中期模型擴展開展可重現的持續控制研究。在多個網路寬度上設計配置匹配的 PPO 實驗，實現受控的動態擴寬，並在相同互動預算下評估學習效率與留出環境上的魯棒性。"],
    "constructed_a_continually_changing_cartpole_environment_with_hidden_gravity_ma": ["Constructed a continually changing CartPole environment with hidden gravity, mass, pole length, force, and friction perturbations.", "构建持续变化的 CartPole 环境，对重力、质量、杆长、作用力和摩擦进行隐藏扰动。", "構建持續變化的 CartPole 環境，對重力、質量、桿長、作用力和摩擦進行隱藏擾動。"],
    "matched_ppo_configurations_and_interaction_budgets_across_network_widths_using": ["Matched PPO configurations and interaction budgets across network widths, using multiple training seeds and held-out evaluation panels.", "在不同网络宽度间保持 PPO 配置与交互预算一致，并使用多个训练随机种子和留出评估环境进行比较。", "在不同網路寬度間保持 PPO 配置與互動預算一致，並使用多個訓練隨機種子和留出評估環境進行比較。"],
    "compared_fixed_width_policies_with_64_128_mid_training_widening_under_default": ["Compared fixed-width policies with 64→128 mid-training widening under default and literal all-zero initialization.", "比较固定宽度策略与训练中期 64→128 动态扩宽，并分别测试默认初始化和严格全零初始化。", "比較固定寬度策略與訓練中期 64→128 動態擴寬，並分別測試預設初始化和嚴格全零初始化。"],
    "built_a_reproducibility_pipeline_that_preserved_configurations_checkpoints_rng": ["Built a reproducibility pipeline that preserved configurations, checkpoints, RNG and environment states, selection records, plots, and evaluation tables.", "搭建可复现实验流程，保存配置、checkpoint、随机数生成器与环境状态、模型选择记录、图表及评估表格。", "搭建可重現實驗流程，保存配置、checkpoint、隨機數生成器與環境狀態、模型選擇記錄、圖表及評估表格。"],
    "developed_a_multi_device_agent_system_for_capability_aware_task_orchestration_text": ["Developed a multi-device agent system for capability-aware task orchestration and reliable execution across heterogeneous devices, combining interface abstraction, execution evidence, and explicit verification of real-world task outcomes.", "开发面向异构设备的多设备 Agent 系统，根据设备能力进行任务编排，并结合接口抽象、执行证据与真实任务结果的显式验证，提高执行可靠性。", "開發面向異質裝置的多裝置 Agent 系統，根據裝置能力進行任務編排，並結合介面抽象、執行證據與真實任務結果的顯式驗證，提高執行可靠性。"],
    "designed_capability_aware_orchestration_for_assigning_tasks_to_devices_and_exe": ["Designed capability-aware orchestration for assigning tasks to devices and execution interfaces suited to each environment.", "设计能力感知的任务编排，根据设备环境将任务分配给合适的设备与执行接口。", "設計能力感知的任務編排，根據裝置環境將任務分配給合適的裝置與執行介面。"],
    "unified_api_cli_and_gui_operations_behind_structured_execution_interfaces_with": ["Unified API, CLI, and GUI operations behind structured execution interfaces with device-adaptive tool selection.", "通过结构化执行接口统一 API、CLI 和 GUI 操作，并根据设备环境选择合适的工具。", "透過結構化執行介面統一 API、CLI 和 GUI 操作，並根據裝置環境選擇合適的工具。"],
    "defined_execution_contracts_that_connect_expected_outputs_collected_evidence_a": ["Defined execution contracts that connect expected outputs, collected evidence, and postconditions instead of treating raw tool success as task completion.", "定义执行契约，将预期输出、采集证据与后置条件关联起来，不再把工具调用成功直接视为任务完成。", "定義執行契約，將預期輸出、採集證據與後置條件關聯起來，不再把工具調用成功直接視為任務完成。"],
    "built_system_evaluation_workflows_for_cross_device_execution_tracking_interfac": ["Built system-evaluation workflows for cross-device execution, tracking interface behavior, completion evidence, and end-state correctness.", "搭建跨设备系统评估流程，跟踪接口行为、完成证据与最终状态是否正确。", "搭建跨裝置系統評估流程，跟蹤介面行為、完成證據與最終狀態是否正確。"],
